cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these notebooks or their results, please cite them as below, and cite simplydata itself."
title: "simplydata_tests: simplydata checked against published reference datasets and its parent packages"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks that run the Python package simplydata on published reference datasets
  (NIST Statistical Reference Datasets with certified values, Student's sleep data, Anscombe's
  quartet, Bliss's beetles, NMES 1988, the NCCTG lung cancer data and others) and compare every
  number with the certified or printed value, with the package simplydata calls underneath
  (pandas, NumPy, SciPy, statsmodels) and with an independent program (R, lifelines).
type: software
authors:
